
README for the fastjet-release/areas/ directory
-----------------------------------------------

QM2006/
        material and plots related specifically to the Quark-Matter
        2006 presentation

area-plots/
        plots relating to area corrections, including 

        - motivational plots (e.g. pt/area scatter) 
        - some Z/Z' mass results.

ttbar/
        plots related to ttbar jet finding (and corrections of UE
        and pileup, etc., there).

hydjet_inclpt/
        plots and runs related to the inclusive pt spectrum as
        obtained with hydjet events for LHC PbPb running

hydjet_eff/
        runs (and plots?) related to studies of the efficiencies in
        jet-finding on hydjet events.


areas-1gluon-for-root.cc
        prints out areas of 1-gluon configurations in a format that's
        suitable for the root scripts in root-games/

